你来我的小公寓待了一会儿，然后就没有室友了吗？

00:04:15.272 --> 00:04:20.982
No. Oh, I'm okay That I might be confusing to someone else now Anyway, it's great to see you again.
不，哦，我没关系，我现在可能会让其他人感到困惑无论如何，很高兴再次见到你。

00:04:20.982 --> 00:04:35.113
I've seen you in ages and you're now you're married Well, first of all you're a musician and an actor I mean forgive me for not knowing this but I didn't even know you were a musician Now this is great information to have and to spread the word.
我已经见过你很多年了，你现在已经结婚了。好吧，首先你是一名音乐家和演员，请原谅我不知道这一点，但我什至不知道你是一名音乐家。现在这是一个很好的信息，值得传播。

00:04:35.113 --> 00:04:43.015
He has a new album called eulogy volume two So there's a eulogy volume one I'm assuming which I'm going to listen to as soon as possible.
他有一张新专辑，名为《悼词第二卷》，所以我想我会尽快听一张《悼词第一卷》。

00:04:43.015 --> 00:04:43.515
Correct.
正确的。

00:04:43.515 --> 00:04:52.686
Yeah Okay, here's a serious question Who is the more annoying group of artists as a successful actor and musician now that I know you're both Who is more sick?
是的，好吧，这是一个严肃的问题，作为一名成功的演员和音乐家，谁是更令人讨厌的艺术家群体，既然我知道你们俩谁更病态？

00:04:52.686 --> 00:04:53.378
Who is more?
谁更多？

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:57.604
Annoying as a group of artists Musicians or actors.
作为一群艺术家、音乐家或演员，很烦人。

00:04:57.604 --> 00:05:18.959
I don't know I don't I don't think of I don't classify people by their of annoyance, but I will say that the musicians I've met, especially in Los Angeles, I now live in Brooklyn, but the musicians I met in LA and in Nashville, where I've spent a lot of time, have been incredibly generous, cool, collaborative people.
我不知道，我不认为我不会根据烦恼来对人们进行分类，但我会说，我遇到的音乐家，尤其是在洛杉矶，我现在住在布鲁克林，但我在洛杉矶和纳什维尔遇到的音乐家，我在那里呆了很多时间，都是非常慷慨、冷静、协作的人。

00:05:18.959 --> 00:05:28.959
Acting is maybe a little more like, mercenary, like, kind of, I don't know, but I've been doing it longer, the acting, so I'm a little more like, delighted by the newness of the music.
表演可能更像是，雇佣兵，有点，我不知道，但我做表演的时间更长，所以我更像是，对音乐的新颖性感到高兴。

00:05:28.959 --> 00:05:30.120
Do you know what I'm saying?
你知道我在说什么吗？

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.620
Absolutely, I understand what you're saying.
绝对，我明白你在说什么。

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:44.500
And I have to say, I have a couple of friends who are not out as musicians yet, they're working on music, but they are actors, two of them specifically that I'm thinking of, and they have the same exact sentiment.
我不得不说，我有几个朋友还没有成为音乐家，他们正在从事音乐工作，但他们是演员，其中两个是我特别想到的，他们有同样的情感。

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:47.860
They're going to be coming out with music, and they're both pretty big stars.
他们将推出音乐作品，而且他们都是相当大的明星。

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:48.860
And I had no idea.
我不知道。

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:49.860
I was like, wait, what, you guys?
我当时想，等等，什么，你们？

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:57.420
